election" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186109829}] :question/id #uuid "00b3cd73-63d0-506c-b47a-e48c2b7ba801" :question/math-academy-id "q-65830" :question/problem "Which of the following points lies on the graph of the function $y = \\arctan x$?\n\n1. $(\\frac{π}{4}, 1)$\n2. $(1, \\frac{π}{4})$\n3. $(\\sqrt{3}, \\frac{4π}{3})$"}]}
